The honest remaining items: the 24px card blur is kept for the design (now cacheable), the Voice Mode card's `--voice-card-glow` border spin still repaints while voice is active (converting it means redesigning that animation), Improve still ships framer-motion in its lazy chunk, and **images are now the largest remaining payload** (~2.4MB in `public/`, biggest disease photos at 200KB).

The cheapest next win is the image pipeline — the same photos at the same visual quality as WebP/AVIF with `srcset` would cut that 2.4MB by more than half.
