Verified: forcing `data-theme="light"` on `<html>` leaves the auth page 100% fixed dark (logo white text, dark translucent inputs, dark glass card, dark sidebar). Mobile media query + background images preserved. Lint/build pass. Done — the auth page is fully isolated, always dark, never light.
