| Never past the screen | ✓ `fitsScreen: true` on every measurement |
| Main card never scrolls for recommendations | ✓ `.obw-rows` keeps `overflow: visible`; only the list scrolls |
| Position, design, layering, logic | ✓ unchanged — options still ranked by the existing fuzzy search |
| Build ✓, lint clean | ✓ |

