Profile Popup redesigned to the modern profile-card layout — everything live-verified:

**New structure (view pane in [Header.jsx](src/components/layout/Header.jsx#L719-L754)):**
```
┌────────────────────────────────┐
│                         [X]    │
│  ┌────────┐  Name              │
│  │ SQUARE │  email             │
│  │  PHOTO │  [Type badge]      │
│  └────────┘                    │
│  [🌐 Language] [🌓 Theme]      │
│  ─────────────────────────     │
│  [Sign Out]      [Edit Profile]│
└────────────────────────────────┘
```

**What changed ([Header.css](src/components/layout/Header.css)):**
- **Photo**: 112px **rounded-square** (20px radius, not a circle, not sharp), 1px subtle border, `object-fit: cover`, positioned **left** in a new hero row with an 18px gap — the clear focal point
- **Dialog**: wider (432→480px, max 720px) and more spacious
- **Identity block** sits beside the photo: 22px/700 name, 13px secondary email, green type badge — real data only (`displayName`, `authEmail`, `profileRole`), nothing hardcoded
- **Language + Theme** controls: same existing buttons, now left-aligned under the identity area
- **Cornerbar** unchanged: thin divider, Sign Out left / Edit Profile right
- Light-mode overrides for every new element (warm-ink family); mobile ≤480px compacts to an 84px photo, 18px name — all overrides placed after base rules so they actually win
- Glass language preserved; nothing added but the hero row — no gradients, no glow, no decorative elements

**Verified live (desktop + 375px mobile, dark + light, en + bn):**
- Square photo (112px/20px radius, true square) left of name/email ✓
- Language menu opens with all 5 options, switch works ✓ — Theme toggled dark→light from the popup ✓
- Sign Out → confirmation opens (exact text + localized buttons), Esc cancels ✓; Edit Profile opens/cancels ✓
- Right-side drawer animation intact; X closes with scroll restore ✓
- Mobile: everything fits, photo left-aligned, zero horizontal overflow ✓
- Removed/absent as required: no camera button, no Delete Account, no duplicates ✓
- Build ✓ (1s), lint **18w/0e**; 7 test keys purged — 0 remaining
