{"kind":"tool","id":"IIskHr7g57Y","toolName":"str_replace","input":{"path":"src/components/layout/Header.css","replacements":[{"oldString":"  /* Transparent glass bar — the aurora shows through.
     PERF: the sticky header is the one glass surface that permanently
     sits over MOVING content, so it re-blurs on every scroll frame. A
     24px blur across the full viewport width was the single most
     expensive blur in the app; 16px (the value the mobile breakpoint
     already used) with a slightly denser tint looks the same at a
     fraction of the per-frame cost. */
  background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--header-bg) 66%, transparent);
  -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(var(--chrome-blur)) saturate(1.3);
  backdrop-filter: blur(var(--chrome-blur)) saturate(1.3);
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--glass-border);","newString":"  /* SOLID near-black bar — opaque, no tint, no frosted blur. The
